review:
I was really happy to see this little guy arrive on Steam after being refurbished.  Obviously played it a lot before and I'm happy to see the gaming world finally is setting its eyes on this jewel.

- Amazing different take on RTS;
- Great AI;
- Even better graphics now;
- TONS of civilizations with a couple new ones;
- Infinite replayability with a good learning curve;
- Good luck trying to beat a moderate+ AI on a conquest objetive large map.
